      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I decided to try out Spite as a villain in the iPad app and found the whoel thing an exercise in frustration.</p><p>What made it even more annoying was what seems to be a bug in the game. The PL602 Compound Omicron card states &quot;The&nbsp;<em>first</em> time Spite would be dealt damage each turn, reduce that damage by H minus 2&quot; (emphasis mine).</p><p>What was happening, though, was that&nbsp;<em>all</em> attacks were being reduced, not just the first one. So all the heroes had to do at least 4 points of damage to even register against Spite, only to see it be erased the next time he hits a hero.</p><p>Pretty much makes the villain unplayable, in my opinion.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
