      "id": 146203,
      "name": "Pydro",
      "username": "Pydro",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-13T02:02:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Each hero, the villain, and the environment have a turn. Once each one had a turn, they complete a round. So, in Spite's case, the card would reduce the first damage each turn, not each round. Also, the number it increases with the number of heroes. This is a case where more heroes can make the game much harder, if you can't deal irrudicible damage.</p><p>Also, welcome to the forums!</p>",
